Package: RGEEtools
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Sampling Ocean Data from Google Earth Engine
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jace", "Innis", email = "jaceinnis@users.noreply.github.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Create regions of interest, sample ocean datasets hosted on
    Google Earth Engine, and convert sampled feature collections to
    data frames. The package currently provides helpers for HYCOM ocean
    velocity, temperature, salinity, and sea surface elevation data.
